1
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:26,000
Inspired by a true love story.

2
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:46,000
The Great Escaper is a history, drama, war film directed by Oliver Parker.

3
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:06,000
In the summer of 2014, a World War II veteran sneaks out of his care home to attend
the 70th anniversary commemoration of the D-Day landings in Normandy.

4
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:26,000
Bernard Jordan, played by Michael Caine.

5
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:46,000
Irene Jordan, played by Glenda Jackson.

6
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:06,000
Arthur, played by John Standing.

7
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:26,000
Young Bernard, played by Will Fletcher.

8
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:46,000
Young Irene, played by Laura Marcus.

9
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Scott, played by Victor Oshin.

10
00:53:20,000 --> 00:53:26,000
The Great Escaper is a 2023 British biographical comedy-drama film directed by Oliver
Parker, written by William Ivory, and starring Michael Caine and Glenda Jackson.

11
00:58:40,000 --> 00:58:46,000
It is based on the true story of 90-year-old  British World War II Royal Navy veteran Bernard Jordan who "broke
out" of his nursing home to attend the 70th anniversary D-Day commemorations in France in June 2014.

12
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
The Great Escaper had its world premiere in London at BFI Southbank on 20 September 2023,
and was released in the United Kingdom on 6 October 2023, by Warner Bros.

13
01:09:20,000 --> 01:09:26,000
The film marked the final performance for Jackson, who died in
June 2023, nine months after filming finished.

14
01:14:40,000 --> 01:14:46,000
Caine announced his retirement from acting in October 2023.

15
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
This is also the last film produced by Pathé UK, after the division announced  in November 2023 that they would
restructure to focus on premium television and only release films from their parent company.

16
01:25:20,000 --> 01:25:26,000
Another film, The Last Rifleman starring Pierce Brosnan and released on
5 November 2023, is loosely based on Jordan's story.

17
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:46,000
The tone is emotional.
